  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- ***I'm A Natural Born Gamblin' Man**: earliest performance in the archive; rare: 3 archived performances [3]\n- **Billy Tells How To Play \"Spin That Bitch**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [3]\n- **Hihway Hypnosis**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [3]\n- **Blackjack**: back after 283 archived shows (1930 days); mythic rare: 2 archived performances [3]\n- **Spin That Bitch**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [3]\n- ***Mr. Mudd and Mr. Gold**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [3]\n- ***Someone Took My Place With You**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [3]\n- **Blacjack County Chain**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [3]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **billystrings2024-12-31** (recommended): source not stated; 39 songs; 228 min [1]\n- **billystrings2024-12-31.mk4v.flac24**: source not stated; 36 songs; 227 min [2]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Stage talk about: Billy [1]\n- This version includes the New Year's countdown and an Auld Lang Syne jam [2]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **billystrings2024-12-31**: taped by Z-Man; transferred by Z-Man; source: Schoeps CCM4V'S>Sound Devices Mix-Pre 6 II (48/32) [1]. Also: Mics were clamped to the front-row rail in Section T, Row 1, between seats 6 and 7, eight feet high; Processed through Sound Forge and CD Wave to 16-bit FLAC, tagged in Foobar 2000; Michelle DeLima assisted the taper [1]\n- **billystrings2024-12-31.mk4v.flac24**: taped by Brian Porter; source: Schoeps mk4v > kcy > Sonosax SX-M2/LS2 > Sony M10 (24/96) [2]. Also: Schoeps MK4V mics went through a KCY and Sonosax preamp into a Sony M10 recorder at 24-bit/96kHz; Transfer went from WAV through Sound Studio and xACT to 24/96 FLAC [2]\n\n## Art and photos\n\n- Poster by @BillybaseDotNet: [Billy Strings UNO Lakefront Arena Nola 24-25 Run Poster Rainbow Foil - BillyBase](https://billybase.net/merch/uno-lakefront-arena-nola-24-25-run-poster-rainbow-foil/) [4]\n- Poster by @BillybaseDotNet: [Billy Strings UNO Lakefront Arena Nola 24-25 Run Poster Rainbow Foil - BillyBase](https://billybase.net/merch/uno-lakefront-arena-nola-24-25-run-poster-rainbow-foil/) [5]\n- Poster by @BillybaseDotNet: [Billy Strings UNO Lakefront Arena NOLA Night 1 Poster Regular - BillyBase](https://billybase.net/merch/uno-lakefront-arena-nola-night-1-poster-regular/) [6]",
